{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#card-zh","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rst 是一个面向 DSH 桌面版与命令行模式的重启插件，通过会话中的 /rst 命令调用独立启动器，关闭当前实例并重新拉起 DSH。它会在重启前记录原会话，待新实例恢复后把完成回执追加到同一会话；也支持 --dry-run 查看计划，以及在普通消息中识别 /rst 作为命令分发的兜底。适合频繁更新插件或配置、需要快速重启并确认恢复状态的使用者。需要 Windows 环境；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:462-511","index.js:163-213","relaunch.cjs:140-223"]}
{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#card-en","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rst adds /rst to restart DSH from a session. A detached launcher restarts the app, then posts a completion receipt in the original session. Use --dry-run to preview the plan. It is useful after plugin or configuration changes. Requires Windows; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:462-511","index.js:163-213","relaunch.cjs:140-223"]}
