{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#feature-1","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rst 的功能「重启 DSH」：在会话中运行 /rst，插件启动独立进程来关闭并重新启动 DSH。桌面模式重开应用，命令行模式用原启动参数拉起。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:462-511","relaunch.cjs:140-223"]}
{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#feature-2","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rst 的功能「原会话完成回执」：触发重启时保存会话标识；新实例等待该会话恢复后，向原会话追加重启完成的命令卡片。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:88-113","index.js:163-213","index.js:484-493"]}
{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#feature-3","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rst 的功能「预览重启计划」：使用 /rst --dry-run 时只返回模式、进程、端口和日志路径等计划信息，不启动重启器。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:277-297","index.js:474-478"]}
{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#feature-4","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rst 的功能「普通消息触发」：当消息通道没有把 /rst 交给命令分发器时，插件监听用户会话事件并识别该命令，再调用相同的重启流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:413-459"]}
{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#caveat-1","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rst 使用 Windows 的 tasklist 和 taskkill 管理进程，因此运行环境受 Windows 系统工具约束；源码也将这些可执行文件定位在 SystemRoot 下。","source":"generated","evidence":["relaunch.cjs:34-36","relaunch.cjs:98-103"]}
{"unit_id":"JingYu-er__dsh-rst#caveat-2","repo":"JingYu-er/dsh-rst","commit":"23f211c8660d56bac8ff42b3677c10115f71f346","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"重启会结束当前 DSH 进程；命令返回前明确提示正在运行的回合会被打断，使用时应预期当前任务中断。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:498-507"]}
